Z||000004||MooCow||11-09-2001||12:20 PM||||Ive been there 3 times already.  I love the place to death.  Taz'z car if awsome.  He used to have a 3800 series II in it, but now has the caddy.  They do awsome work at the factory.  Did you get to see the formula converted to a fastback??  The white coupe I got to drive and that is what got me hooked on the 3.4 with the 4:10.  Now I want to go back so I can visit everyone again and to also test drive the 4.9.<BR>Haha thats cool that you seen my name.<P>Thanks Ken<P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/forum_pic.jpg"> ||||reg||10
